# Conventional Commits: type(scope): description
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, ci (extend as needed)
# Add ! before ':' for a breaking change, e.g. feat(api)!: change response format
# Keep the subject concise and imperative.

type(scope): description

# Optional: explain the motivation and relevant context.

# Optional footers: Closes #123 / Refs #123
# Breaking changes: BREAKING CHANGE: describe impact and migration
